/-!
# Marked original-section partitions for 14.7.69

`Data.exists_criticalChart` constructs the actual Sylow coordinates in the
branch Uα*=Q*. The original V/V₁ is identified by its L₁ action; the original
fixed and moved spaces, nonidentity-actor displacement bounds, and marked
fixed-plane partitions are proved in the imported modules.

`CriticalChart.original_module_calculations` gives exactly the original-map
premises used by the independent critical intersection argument. The lift
to E=U∩Uα and the literal ambient commutator set remains a separate step;
this entry point does not assert the final order-two theorem.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
14.7.65 and 14.7.69, printed pp.1070, 1072–1073.
-/
